EESchema Schematic File Version 7
EELAYER 0 0
EELAYER END
$Descr A4 11700 8268
encoding utf-8
Sheet 1 1
Title "WasteSort Countertop Sorter"
Date "2026-08-22"
Rev "1.0"
Comp "Devices"
Comment1 "ESP32-S3 + OV2640 + AS7341 + GM65 barcode scanner"
Comment2 "Servo diverter + ToF occupancy + LED guidance ring"
Comment3 "Power rails: 12V, 5V, 3V3"
Comment4 "Buses: DVP, I2C, UART, PWM, SPI"
$EndDescr

$Comp
L power:+3V3 #PWR01
U 1 1 65000001
P 1800 1000
F 0 "#PWR01" H 1800 850 50 0001 C CNN
F 1 "+3V3" H 1815 1173 50 0000 C CNN
F 2 "" H 1800 1000 50 0001 C CNN
F 3 "" H 1800 1000 50 0001 C CNN
1 1800 1000
1 0 0 -1
$EndComp

$Comp
