U 1 1 65000002
P 4200 2600
F 0 "U1" H 4200 3400 50 0000 C CNN
F 1 "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1" H 4200 3300 50 0000 C CNN
F 2 "Module:ESP32-S3-WROOM-1" H 4200 2600 50 0001 C CNN
F 3 "" H 4200 2600 50 0001 C CNN
1 4200 2600
1 0 0 -1
$EndComp

$Comp
L Device:U U_CAMERA
U 1 1 65000003
P 7600 2600
F 0 "U2" H 7600 3400 50 0000 C CNN
F 1 "OV2640" H 7600 3300 50 0000 C CNN
F 2 "Module:OV2640" H 7600 2600 50 0001 C CNN
F 3 "" H 7600 2600 50 0001 C CNN
1 7600 2600
1 0 0 -1
$EndComp

Text Notes 1200 7000 0 50 ~ 0
